# Other project lines living in this workspace are not part of the Moodify
# mainline. They keep their own branches and worktrees; their working copies
# stay on disk but never enter this repository.
/web 3.0/
/docs/mood/

# ── MOOD Protocol line (Web3) — moved out of the mainline 2026-10-03 ──
# The MOOD token line is live infrastructure, not residue: an EVM/BSC mainnet
# BEP-20 token (MOOD, 0x1BB3115D43E397f7bb586F090831B02cA639e73E, 33,000,000
# supply) with a deployed contract and DEX trading. MOODIFY_NETWORK_RESTRUCTURE_001
# moved it out of the mainline WITHOUT deleting it from disk — the untracked part
# of web 3.0/ is the contract authority for shipped code in
# moodify-core-package/src/moodify/contribution/ (ruling of 2026-09-29).
# DO NOT DELETE THESE FROM DISK. Recover tracking with:
#   git checkout pre-network-restructure-2026-10-03 -- protocol/ apps/web e2e/staging
/mood-web3-protocol/
/apps/web/
/e2e/

